'''Put On Ice''' (氷上競技, ''Hyōjō Kyōgi'', '''Winter Sports''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (Sm): Cats' movement speed increases by 10%.

